tar No. V, 1917. Watercolor on paper, 8 5/8 x 11 5/8 inches (sheet). McNay Art Museum. Collection of the McNay Art Museum, Bequest of Helen Miller Jones (1989.36). © Georgia O'Keeffe Museum","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"cr_remarks_1999","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/local/cr_remarks_1999"}],"content":["Not recorded Whitney Archive. Abiquiú Notebooks indicates lost inscription on original backing, \"Back: O'K: \"No. 5'\" [No. 5 is Downtown Gallery inventory number]. Abiquiú Notebooks indicates lost inscription on original backing, \"Back: O'K: \"No. 5\" [No. 5 is Downtown Gallery inventory number]. (Source: Lynes, 1999)"],"type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[{"digitally_shown_by":[{"access_point":[{"id":"https://iiif.okeeffemuseum.org/image/iiif/2/857691/full/full/0/default.jpg","type":"DigitalObject"}],"classified_as":[{"_label":"Digital Image","id":"http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300215302","type":"Type"}],"digitally_available_via":[{"access_point":[{"id":"https://iiif.okeeffemuseum.org/image/iiif/2/857691"}],"conforms_to":[{"id":"http://iiif.io/api/image","type":"InformationObject"}],"format":"application/ld+json;profile='http://iiif.io/api/image/2/context.json'","type":"DigitalService"}],"type":"DigitalObject"}],"type":"VisualItem"}],"type":"HumanMadeObject"}